      "title": "My latest books cartoon for The Guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a8adbb23/294baf8bbbb07e82-41/s640x960/a8d541bbec0e02d8bd829a059a5b28c159a77634.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"865\" data-orig-width=\"1600\" alt=\"Panel 1 Caption: With the windows open in the summer heat, a breeze blows through the punctuation factory, scattering newly-minted marks across the countryside.  Image: a small factory with windows open and punctuation marks coming out   Panel 2 Caption: Confused locals find their conversations peppered with unexpected pauses and unwanted emphasis.  Image: Two people talking as punctuation marks float around them One says  This, is &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;very odd&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;  The other replies   &#xE2;&#x80;&#xA6;(Indeed)*   Panel 3 Caption: Naturalists note that the effect is not limited to human communication.   Image: A duck on a pond surrounded by punctuation marks says Qu&#xE2;&#x80;&#x99;ack?  Panel 4 Caption: Fortunately, a cloud of exclamation points drift into a district council meeting which proceeds with unusual efficiency   Image: Councillors talk in a cloud of exclamation points Something must be done!!  ! Close the windows! !! Install air conditioning! !! Immediately!!! !  \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a8adbb23/294baf8bbbb07e82-41/s75x75_c1/9c1db18c193a86e1f25c017eecfbec3999bc81a1.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a8adbb23/294baf8bbbb07e82-41/s100x200/52be8d72155be4afa575cfa27fa0d2217d9c414d.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a8adbb23/294baf8bbbb07e82-41/s250x400/db59b5973cbe8d05f2d884453108432b9feb28f8.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a8adbb23/294baf8bbbb07e82-41/s400x600/e8b5a6caa9eaf4950a6461622d6249d7707fcb83.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a8adbb23/294baf8bbbb07e82-41/s500x750/58515232848ebb2e127adfc26c31964cb132a62f.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/5bd9abd400756f7f04b66989a